--      expense atomically; expense amount = commission on posted receipts,
--      split mirrored from the income.
--   2. Re-running the same create raises duplicate_object (P0004) with a
--      detail JSON naming the existing project — never a second expense.
--   3. Creating an income for an existing (unposted) partner+name+client
--      project ATTACHES to it; no second project row.
--   4. attach with a different value/rate is rejected with a clear message.
--   5. upsert_apn_commission_project blocks duplicate partner+name+client
--      (cancelled projects excluded).
--   6. get_apn_commission_state returns project/collections/income/expense and
--      flags orphan finance rows; finance/admin only, no anon grant.
--   7. anon EXECUTE surface unchanged (39), no new anon grants — each function
--      is explicitly revoked from public AND anon before the authenticated
--      grant, so stale per-role anon grants cannot survive re-runs.
